cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "allocation-ope-bench"
abstract: >
  A reproducible benchmark for offline evaluation of budget-constrained
  allocation policies. Stress-tests six fixed-policy OPE estimators (plus a
  smoothed-policy sensitivity estimator scored against its own estimand) across five public
  datasets under varying logging overlap and policy-fitting regimes; includes a
  dedicated optimizer's-curse experiment and practitioner decision guide.
authors:
